# AI Assistant Plugin Guidelines

## Architecture
- Location: `/packages/ui-plugins/ai-assistant-plugin/`
- Framework: React + TypeScript
- Pattern: Functional components with custom hooks
- Don't modify build config without asking

## Project Structure
```
src/
├── components/     # UI components
├── hooks/          # Custom hooks for logic
├── services/       # API communication
├── types/          # TypeScript definitions
├── constants/      # Configuration & constants
└── utils/          # Utility functions
```

## Team Coordination
- **Backend**: Sagar Sharma - don't break their API
- **Vector DB**: Akhil & Ishita - coordinate changes
- This is a team project - be respectful of others' work
